### EsportsHub — Demo podaci za prezentaciju
### Run all (⏩). Admin brise sve podatke i puni bazu demo podacima.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Admin login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "admin", "password": "admin12345" }

> {% client.global.set("demoAdmin", response.body.token); %}

### 2. Reset i demo podaci -> 200 { users, teams, tournaments, listings }
POST {{host}}/api/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{demoAdmin}}

### 3. Dino se prijavljuje demo lozinkom
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usernameOrEmail": "dino", "password": "lozinka123" }
